          "level": 1,
          "text": "CONTEXT — `verifyKind` rejected; manual confirmation belongs in an attestation artifact, not in `runGoalCheck`",
          "anchor": "context-verifykind-rejected-manual-confirmation-belongs-in-an-attestation-artifact-not-in-rungoalcheck",
          "githubAnchor": "context-verifykind-rejected-manual-confirmation-belongs-in-an-attestation-artifact-not-in-rungoalcheck",
          "stableAnchor": "h-3dfd0d5c9964"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What was proposed",
          "anchor": "what-was-proposed",
          "githubAnchor": "what-was-proposed",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f62beeffe3b6"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why it was rejected",
          "anchor": "why-it-was-rejected",
          "githubAnchor": "why-it-was-rejected",
          "stableAnchor": "h-d86be58d618b"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1. The stated blocker does not exist",
          "anchor": "1-the-stated-blocker-does-not-exist",
          "githubAnchor": "1-the-stated-blocker-does-not-exist",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f1e459a3b623"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "2. The design grew every round instead of converging",
          "anchor": "2-the-design-grew-every-round-instead-of-converging",
          "githubAnchor": "2-the-design-grew-every-round-instead-of-converging",
          "stableAnchor": "h-8b77a76393ad"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "3. `catchup` has no answer under this design, and the report admits it",
          "anchor": "3-catchup-has-no-answer-under-this-design-and-the-report-admits-it",
          "githubAnchor": "3-catchup-has-no-answer-under-this-design-and-the-report-admits-it",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2232bbe8dce6"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "4. It attacks three locked laws for a hypothetical payoff",
