          "githubAnchor": "add-a-read-only-fgos-verb-and-its-plugin-skill",
          "stableAnchor": "h-6952a0001959"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "1. Write the pure function first, separately from the CLI",
          "anchor": "1-write-the-pure-function-first-separately-from-the-cli",
          "githubAnchor": "1-write-the-pure-function-first-separately-from-the-cli",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2b13abb90c3c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2. Register it in `COMMAND_REGISTRY`",
          "anchor": "2-register-it-in-command_registry",
          "githubAnchor": "2-register-it-in-command_registry",
          "stableAnchor": "h-76e19bc363bd"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "3. Add the plugin skill wrapper",
          "anchor": "3-add-the-plugin-skill-wrapper",
          "githubAnchor": "3-add-the-plugin-skill-wrapper",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1349468ab121"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A real bug this pattern prevents (`tsk-2ew`): a missing `--dir` looks like an empty backlog, not an error",
          "anchor": "a-real-bug-this-pattern-prevents-tsk-2ew-a-missing---dir-looks-like-an-empty-backlog-not-an-error",
          "githubAnchor": "a-real-bug-this-pattern-prevents-tsk-2ew-a-missing---dir-looks-like-an-empty-backlog-not-an-error",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1f5ae75d8688"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "4. Test at both layers",
          "anchor": "4-test-at-both-layers",
          "githubAnchor": "4-test-at-both-layers",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b472ceac0c7e"
        }
