          "level": 1,
          "text": "`fgos approve`'s \"verify-only\" mode checks the current cwd, not the item's real branch",
          "anchor": "fgos-approves-verify-only-mode-checks-the-current-cwd-not-the-items-real-branch",
          "githubAnchor": "fgos-approves-verify-only-mode-checks-the-current-cwd-not-the-items-real-branch",
          "stableAnchor": "h-8ca8234f153f"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why this isn't data loss (but is easy to misread as a bug)",
          "anchor": "why-this-isnt-data-loss-but-is-easy-to-misread-as-a-bug",
          "githubAnchor": "why-this-isnt-data-loss-but-is-easy-to-misread-as-a-bug",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1c7ed01336e6"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The real gap: \"verify-only\" verifies against whatever `main`'s cwd",
          "anchor": "the-real-gap-verify-only-verifies-against-whatever-mains-cwd",
          "githubAnchor": "the-real-gap-verify-only-verifies-against-whatever-mains-cwd",
          "stableAnchor": "h-eebe0a0bda2a"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "currently contains, not the item's own real branch content",
          "anchor": "currently-contains-not-the-items-own-real-branch-content",
          "githubAnchor": "currently-contains-not-the-items-own-real-branch-content",
          "stableAnchor": "h-86e19824f47c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A second, unrelated real finding along the way: `discover`'s ask path races under concurrent sessions",
