          "level": 1,
          "text": "Why `/fgOS:cook` claims a worktree before driving instead of dirtying the main checkout",
          "anchor": "why-fgoscook-claims-a-worktree-before-driving-instead-of-dirtying-the-main-checkout",
          "githubAnchor": "why-fgoscook-claims-a-worktree-before-driving-instead-of-dirtying-the-main-checkout",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a254c199db22"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The bug, confirmed live before the fix",
