        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "How to close out a goalTier milestone/MVP item once all its targets are done",
          "anchor": "how-to-close-out-a-goaltier-milestonemvp-item-once-all-its-targets-are-done",
          "githubAnchor": "how-to-close-out-a-goaltier-milestonemvp-item-once-all-its-targets-are-done",
          "stableAnchor": "h-081388b88ba5"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Watch out for: `rollup`'s plain `doneCount`/`totalCount` reads `0/0` for a targets-based milestone — that's not the field to check",
          "anchor": "watch-out-for-rollups-plain-donecounttotalcount-reads-00-for-a-targets-based-milestone-thats-not-the-field-to-check",
          "githubAnchor": "watch-out-for-rollups-plain-donecounttotalcount-reads-00-for-a-targets-based-milestone-thats-not-the-field-to-check",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f99e1dc62046"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "If the milestone was created via `fgos submit` instead of `fgos add`",
          "anchor": "if-the-milestone-was-created-via-fgos-submit-instead-of-fgos-add",
          "githubAnchor": "if-the-milestone-was-created-via-fgos-submit-instead-of-fgos-add",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0cbf48a1ec6b"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Before you start",
          "anchor": "before-you-start",
          "githubAnchor": "before-you-start",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f1bcb77d6a97"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Steps",
          "anchor": "steps",
          "githubAnchor": "steps",
          "stableAnchor": "h-d8f45a02a1a3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Real example",
          "anchor": "real-example",
          "githubAnchor": "real-example",
          "stableAnchor": "h-095ef79dac6b"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Real-world lesson: a target sitting in `cleanup` has already delivered — don't wait out its TTL",
          "anchor": "real-world-lesson-a-target-sitting-in-cleanup-has-already-delivered-dont-wait-out-its-ttl",
          "githubAnchor": "real-world-lesson-a-target-sitting-in-cleanup-has-already-delivered-dont-wait-out-its-ttl",
          "stableAnchor": "h-58b6cecd600a"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Real-world lesson: a milestone verify that only reads status is vacuous — check the content it claims",
          "anchor": "real-world-lesson-a-milestone-verify-that-only-reads-status-is-vacuous-check-the-content-it-claims",
          "githubAnchor": "real-world-lesson-a-milestone-verify-that-only-reads-status-is-vacuous-check-the-content-it-claims",
          "stableAnchor": "h-338745492972"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why this doesn't happen automatically",
