      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "How to fix a `fgos-write-rejected` merge block on a `.fgos/` change",
          "anchor": "how-to-fix-a-fgos-write-rejected-merge-block-on-a-fgos-change",
          "githubAnchor": "how-to-fix-a-fgos-write-rejected-merge-block-on-a-fgos-change",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c5b65ff09194"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Before you start",
          "anchor": "before-you-start",
          "githubAnchor": "before-you-start",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a4d4b91752ea"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why this is rejected, not just a warning",
          "anchor": "why-this-is-rejected-not-just-a-warning",
          "githubAnchor": "why-this-is-rejected-not-just-a-warning",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f7413c58e708"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Steps",
          "anchor": "steps",
          "githubAnchor": "steps",
          "stableAnchor": "h-786660e265cc"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Example: real before/after from the store",
          "anchor": "example-real-beforeafter-from-the-store",
          "githubAnchor": "example-real-beforeafter-from-the-store",
          "stableAnchor": "h-04937270687b"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Example: `tsk-5vf` — the block stacks with a second, unrelated one",
          "anchor": "example-tsk-5vf-the-block-stacks-with-a-second-unrelated-one",
          "githubAnchor": "example-tsk-5vf-the-block-stacks-with-a-second-unrelated-one",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4f0071d47d25"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Example: `tsk-4eu` — the block recurs when the fix itself must edit `.fgos/config.json`",
          "anchor": "example-tsk-4eu-the-block-recurs-when-the-fix-itself-must-edit-fgosconfigjson",
          "githubAnchor": "example-tsk-4eu-the-block-recurs-when-the-fix-itself-must-edit-fgosconfigjson",
          "stableAnchor": "h-6a0b71272946"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Example: `tsk-5ge` — the follow-up item that lands the config change directly on main",
          "anchor": "example-tsk-5ge-the-follow-up-item-that-lands-the-config-change-directly-on-main",
          "githubAnchor": "example-tsk-5ge-the-follow-up-item-that-lands-the-config-change-directly-on-main",
          "stableAnchor": "h-cc0267949330"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Example: `tsk-28o` — a child item forked from an already-merged sibling inherits that sibling's own diff",
          "anchor": "example-tsk-28o-a-child-item-forked-from-an-already-merged-sibling-inherits-that-siblings-own-diff",
          "githubAnchor": "example-tsk-28o-a-child-item-forked-from-an-already-merged-sibling-inherits-that-siblings-own-diff",
          "stableAnchor": "h-247406335d4b"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Example: `tsk-53n` — a fourth reason to narrow `verify`: an unrelated pre-existing red test at the fork point",
          "anchor": "example-tsk-53n-a-fourth-reason-to-narrow-verify-an-unrelated-pre-existing-red-test-at-the-fork-point",
          "githubAnchor": "example-tsk-53n-a-fourth-reason-to-narrow-verify-an-unrelated-pre-existing-red-test-at-the-fork-point",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4d74ce131c9c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Example: `tsk-3v2` — the block triggers from merging main in, not from your own commit",
          "anchor": "example-tsk-3v2-the-block-triggers-from-merging-main-in-not-from-your-own-commit",
          "githubAnchor": "example-tsk-3v2-the-block-triggers-from-merging-main-in-not-from-your-own-commit",
          "stableAnchor": "h-52914013f8a7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Related",
          "anchor": "related",
          "githubAnchor": "related",
          "stableAnchor": "h-dc785a308c2b"
        },
        {
