          "level": 1,
          "text": "Verify-cost audit: real pick/return/approve cycle counts",
          "anchor": "verify-cost-audit-real-pickreturnapprove-cycle-counts",
          "githubAnchor": "verify-cost-audit-real-pickreturnapprove-cycle-counts",
          "stableAnchor": "h-78cfe1e9cca7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "(1) Pick rounds per item, through `delivered`",
          "anchor": "1-pick-rounds-per-item-through-delivered",
          "githubAnchor": "1-pick-rounds-per-item-through-delivered",
          "stableAnchor": "h-6d9aaa761db0"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "(2) Return rounds, and how many resolve to `blocked`",
          "anchor": "2-return-rounds-and-how-many-resolve-to-blocked",
          "githubAnchor": "2-return-rounds-and-how-many-resolve-to-blocked",
          "stableAnchor": "h-019cecba41c5"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Approve rounds (a separate lifecycle step, same audit)",
          "anchor": "approve-rounds-a-separate-lifecycle-step-same-audit",
          "githubAnchor": "approve-rounds-a-separate-lifecycle-step-same-audit",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a4aa4f44caf5"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "(3) Real failure-cause distribution (`work.friction.errorClass`)",
          "anchor": "3-real-failure-cause-distribution-workfrictionerrorclass",
          "githubAnchor": "3-real-failure-cause-distribution-workfrictionerrorclass",
          "stableAnchor": "h-98422d65a6f7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "(4) Full-verify (`npm test`) run count — total and estimate",
          "anchor": "4-full-verify-npm-test-run-count-total-and-estimate",
          "githubAnchor": "4-full-verify-npm-test-run-count-total-and-estimate",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b389e9ab30ef"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Data limitations, stated plainly",
