          "stableAnchor": "h-f3c55e5e5c76"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The bug had three layers, not one",
          "anchor": "the-bug-had-three-layers-not-one",
          "githubAnchor": "the-bug-had-three-layers-not-one",
          "stableAnchor": "h-422feb5b25bd"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why this is a contract gap, not a model-quality problem",
