          "githubAnchor": "why-this-is-a-contract-gap-not-a-model-quality-problem",
          "stableAnchor": "h-acb8b52c3a89"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The fix: two new fields, generated in the same LLM call, mechanically checked",
