          "githubAnchor": "the-fix-two-new-fields-generated-in-the-same-llm-call-mechanically-checked",
          "stableAnchor": "h-75ed4b6a77bf"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Why the two rejected alternatives were rejected",
          "anchor": "why-the-two-rejected-alternatives-were-rejected",
          "githubAnchor": "why-the-two-rejected-alternatives-were-rejected",
          "stableAnchor": "h-252a77b8b642"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Scope: fixes both decompose paths, deliberately excludes `fgos add --parent`",
          "anchor": "scope-fixes-both-decompose-paths-deliberately-excludes-fgos-add---parent",
          "githubAnchor": "scope-fixes-both-decompose-paths-deliberately-excludes-fgos-add---parent",
          "stableAnchor": "h-17a0297ae405"
        },
        {
