          "level": 1,
          "text": "Why `fgos add` items landed permanently at stage `executing`, with no path back",
          "anchor": "why-fgos-add-items-landed-permanently-at-stage-executing-with-no-path-back",
          "githubAnchor": "why-fgos-add-items-landed-permanently-at-stage-executing-with-no-path-back",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ea327cdd3077"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The mechanism",
          "anchor": "the-mechanism",
          "githubAnchor": "the-mechanism",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4df84d2a201e"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why this wasn't a rare edge case",
          "anchor": "why-this-wasnt-a-rare-edge-case",
          "githubAnchor": "why-this-wasnt-a-rare-edge-case",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2cc76b294f7f"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The fix: change the default going forward, never add a back-edge",
