          "level": 1,
          "text": "Why fgOS refuses a staged `.fgos` deletion at commit time",
          "anchor": "why-fgos-refuses-a-staged-fgos-deletion-at-commit-time",
          "githubAnchor": "why-fgos-refuses-a-staged-fgos-deletion-at-commit-time",
          "stableAnchor": "h-57343e093f4d"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Near miss 1: `git add -A` in a worktree stages the live event log's deletion",
          "anchor": "near-miss-1-git-add--a-in-a-worktree-stages-the-live-event-logs-deletion",
          "githubAnchor": "near-miss-1-git-add--a-in-a-worktree-stages-the-live-event-logs-deletion",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ada23426d4f7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Near miss 2: `git stash` on the shared main checkout can roll back live state",
          "anchor": "near-miss-2-git-stash-on-the-shared-main-checkout-can-roll-back-live-state",
          "githubAnchor": "near-miss-2-git-stash-on-the-shared-main-checkout-can-roll-back-live-state",
          "stableAnchor": "h-bd171c333647"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why this needed a written warning, not just a guard",
          "anchor": "why-this-needed-a-written-warning-not-just-a-guard",
          "githubAnchor": "why-this-needed-a-written-warning-not-just-a-guard",
          "stableAnchor": "h-3b752a9f9cb7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The general shape: catch it at the moment it happens, not the moment it's discovered",
          "anchor": "the-general-shape-catch-it-at-the-moment-it-happens-not-the-moment-its-discovered",
