      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "Why fgOS citations carry a gloss, checked mechanically",
          "anchor": "why-fgos-citations-carry-a-gloss-checked-mechanically",
          "githubAnchor": "why-fgos-citations-carry-a-gloss-checked-mechanically",
          "stableAnchor": "h-522f7afebbd8"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The three-tier ID structure itself was validated, not the defect",
          "anchor": "the-three-tier-id-structure-itself-was-validated-not-the-defect",
          "githubAnchor": "the-three-tier-id-structure-itself-was-validated-not-the-defect",
          "stableAnchor": "h-47268f796117"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Scope narrowed to avoid duplicating a sibling item's work",
          "anchor": "scope-narrowed-to-avoid-duplicating-a-sibling-items-work",
          "githubAnchor": "scope-narrowed-to-avoid-duplicating-a-sibling-items-work",
          "stableAnchor": "h-8a6238f4a33d"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Extending the existing citation-drift script, not writing a third one",
          "anchor": "extending-the-existing-citation-drift-script-not-writing-a-third-one",
          "githubAnchor": "extending-the-existing-citation-drift-script-not-writing-a-third-one",
          "stableAnchor": "h-aee142038a77"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A found scope gap: `plugins/fgOS/skills/` was silently dropped from the original measurement",
          "anchor": "a-found-scope-gap-pluginsfgosskills-was-silently-dropped-from-the-original-measurement",
          "githubAnchor": "a-found-scope-gap-pluginsfgosskills-was-silently-dropped-from-the-original-measurement",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9ace62a70dc3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The baseline ratchet, and a self-correction about its own precedent",
          "anchor": "the-baseline-ratchet-and-a-self-correction-about-its-own-precedent",
          "githubAnchor": "the-baseline-ratchet-and-a-self-correction-about-its-own-precedent",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9eeb64e7af6e"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What \"done\" means for a ratchet-shaped check",
          "anchor": "what-done-means-for-a-ratchet-shaped-check",
          "githubAnchor": "what-done-means-for-a-ratchet-shaped-check",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1e50f65f4f49"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A real follow-up bug: the baseline was keyed by line number, not content",
          "anchor": "a-real-follow-up-bug-the-baseline-was-keyed-by-line-number-not-content",
          "githubAnchor": "a-real-follow-up-bug-the-baseline-was-keyed-by-line-number-not-content",
          "stableAnchor": "h-f77a95cd0775"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A second-order bug the re-keying fix itself introduced (`tsk-6at`)",
          "anchor": "a-second-order-bug-the-re-keying-fix-itself-introduced-tsk-6at",
          "githubAnchor": "a-second-order-bug-the-re-keying-fix-itself-introduced-tsk-6at",
          "stableAnchor": "h-910a97bb7704"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The wrapper generator's own boilerplate was violating the rule it lives next to (`tsk-352f`)",
          "anchor": "the-wrapper-generators-own-boilerplate-was-violating-the-rule-it-lives-next-to-tsk-352f",
          "githubAnchor": "the-wrapper-generators-own-boilerplate-was-violating-the-rule-it-lives-next-to-tsk-352f",
          "stableAnchor": "h-48032bf2ef39"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The two flagged-but-deferred findings finally closed (`tsk-1pf`)",
          "anchor": "the-two-flagged-but-deferred-findings-finally-closed-tsk-1pf",
          "githubAnchor": "the-two-flagged-but-deferred-findings-finally-closed-tsk-1pf",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a00bf5e8844c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Source",
          "anchor": "source",
          "githubAnchor": "source",
          "stableAnchor": "h-426a22b0db4c"
        }
