          "text": "Why fgOS's merge safety work shipped as ten items under one milestone",
          "anchor": "why-fgoss-merge-safety-work-shipped-as-ten-items-under-one-milestone",
          "githubAnchor": "why-fgoss-merge-safety-work-shipped-as-ten-items-under-one-milestone",
          "stableAnchor": "h-59d5ab4fed2a"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why one milestone instead of ten unrelated bugs",
          "anchor": "why-one-milestone-instead-of-ten-unrelated-bugs",
          "githubAnchor": "why-one-milestone-instead-of-ten-unrelated-bugs",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1321762e9a2e"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
