          "stableAnchor": "h-835d55a409e3"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The failure this closes",
          "anchor": "the-failure-this-closes",
          "githubAnchor": "the-failure-this-closes",
          "stableAnchor": "h-89d3b93b1f62"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why a second model pass, not a syntax lint",
          "anchor": "why-a-second-model-pass-not-a-syntax-lint",
          "githubAnchor": "why-a-second-model-pass-not-a-syntax-lint",
          "stableAnchor": "h-75dd751fc750"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why disagreement parks instead of retrying",
          "anchor": "why-disagreement-parks-instead-of-retrying",
          "githubAnchor": "why-disagreement-parks-instead-of-retrying",
          "stableAnchor": "h-65efcd120282"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why the fail-safe contract still holds",
          "anchor": "why-the-fail-safe-contract-still-holds",
          "githubAnchor": "why-the-fail-safe-contract-still-holds",
          "stableAnchor": "h-fa4af069ff92"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Scope boundary",
          "anchor": "scope-boundary",
          "githubAnchor": "scope-boundary",
          "stableAnchor": "h-dcaf87c1a8b0"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why the parent item (`tsk-5q5`) locked scope before design",
          "anchor": "why-the-parent-item-tsk-5q5-locked-scope-before-design",
          "githubAnchor": "why-the-parent-item-tsk-5q5-locked-scope-before-design",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2d28f78c8d02"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Second repro: unquoted prose breaks the shell, not just names the wrong target",
          "anchor": "second-repro-unquoted-prose-breaks-the-shell-not-just-names-the-wrong-target",
          "githubAnchor": "second-repro-unquoted-prose-breaks-the-shell-not-just-names-the-wrong-target",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0a26bf96d624"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "When the second pass disagrees with itself, not just the first pass",
          "anchor": "when-the-second-pass-disagrees-with-itself-not-just-the-first-pass",
          "githubAnchor": "when-the-second-pass-disagrees-with-itself-not-just-the-first-pass",
          "stableAnchor": "h-72842852c3b0"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "`--force` overriding the verdict is not the same as clearing the park it caused",
          "anchor": "--force-overriding-the-verdict-is-not-the-same-as-clearing-the-park-it-caused",
          "githubAnchor": "--force-overriding-the-verdict-is-not-the-same-as-clearing-the-park-it-caused",
          "stableAnchor": "h-2d69b7555b65"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The mirror gap (`tsk-60r`): a genuinely SUCCESSFUL re-run also left a stale park behind",
          "anchor": "the-mirror-gap-tsk-60r-a-genuinely-successful-re-run-also-left-a-stale-park-behind",
          "githubAnchor": "the-mirror-gap-tsk-60r-a-genuinely-successful-re-run-also-left-a-stale-park-behind",
          "stableAnchor": "h-6c828de133bf"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A new root cause for repeated disputes (`tsk-3jy`): the judge wasn't told what stage it's grading",
          "anchor": "a-new-root-cause-for-repeated-disputes-tsk-3jy-the-judge-wasnt-told-what-stage-its-grading",
          "githubAnchor": "a-new-root-cause-for-repeated-disputes-tsk-3jy-the-judge-wasnt-told-what-stage-its-grading",
          "stableAnchor": "h-7d2412812bcb"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Second live contradiction (`tsk-25g`): single-round context wasn't enough, full history was",
          "anchor": "second-live-contradiction-tsk-25g-single-round-context-wasnt-enough-full-history-was",
          "githubAnchor": "second-live-contradiction-tsk-25g-single-round-context-wasnt-enough-full-history-was",
          "stableAnchor": "h-62e60641def9"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Test-coverage gap closed (`tsk-5ld`): `resolveDiscovery`'s `--force` had shipped code with no test",
