          "githubAnchor": "the-accepted-fields-list-is-read-from-the-engine-never-re-declared",
          "stableAnchor": "h-44d89daaf1d7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Validation stays in the engine — the gateway never re-implements it",
