      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "Why the herdr web dashboard became a static client of the gateway, not its own server",
          "anchor": "why-the-herdr-web-dashboard-became-a-static-client-of-the-gateway-not-its-own-server",
          "githubAnchor": "why-the-herdr-web-dashboard-became-a-static-client-of-the-gateway-not-its-own-server",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0e64c6db78ea"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The original design (D1, D7-D9, D14) — a standalone embedded webserver",
          "anchor": "the-original-design-d1-d7-d9-d14-a-standalone-embedded-webserver",
          "githubAnchor": "the-original-design-d1-d7-d9-d14-a-standalone-embedded-webserver",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e8c68570c836"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The realignment — a later pass superseded the server, kept the toolchain",
          "anchor": "the-realignment-a-later-pass-superseded-the-server-kept-the-toolchain",
          "githubAnchor": "the-realignment-a-later-pass-superseded-the-server-kept-the-toolchain",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0d754673d68f"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why the UI spec gates the mechanical build steps, not the reverse (`tsk-3x6`)",
          "anchor": "why-the-ui-spec-gates-the-mechanical-build-steps-not-the-reverse-tsk-3x6",
          "githubAnchor": "why-the-ui-spec-gates-the-mechanical-build-steps-not-the-reverse-tsk-3x6",
          "stableAnchor": "h-593981491e3c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "P1 landed (`tsk-48w`): survived realignment as a config flag, not a closed item",
          "anchor": "p1-landed-tsk-48w-survived-realignment-as-a-config-flag-not-a-closed-item",
          "githubAnchor": "p1-landed-tsk-48w-survived-realignment-as-a-config-flag-not-a-closed-item",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e5859fe274ed"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "P3 (`tsk-5jr`): the taskboard list view, and the contract-as-single-source rule",
          "anchor": "p3-tsk-5jr-the-taskboard-list-view-and-the-contract-as-single-source-rule",
          "githubAnchor": "p3-tsk-5jr-the-taskboard-list-view-and-the-contract-as-single-source-rule",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ee085f0b2dab"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "P4 (`tsk-4id`): the task-detail view, the cluster's actual main goal",
          "anchor": "p4-tsk-4id-the-task-detail-view-the-clusters-actual-main-goal",
          "githubAnchor": "p4-tsk-4id-the-task-detail-view-the-clusters-actual-main-goal",
          "stableAnchor": "h-be337786f87e"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The frontend scaffold split out as its own item (`tsk-yo0`)",
          "anchor": "the-frontend-scaffold-split-out-as-its-own-item-tsk-yo0",
          "githubAnchor": "the-frontend-scaffold-split-out-as-its-own-item-tsk-yo0",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ecb417ad1c45"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "This item is the realignment itself (`tsk-6d2`)",
          "anchor": "this-item-is-the-realignment-itself-tsk-6d2",
          "githubAnchor": "this-item-is-the-realignment-itself-tsk-6d2",
          "stableAnchor": "h-02335dbbc77e"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What didn't change: why the webserver outlives the cockpit pane (D12)",
          "anchor": "what-didnt-change-why-the-webserver-outlives-the-cockpit-pane-d12",
          "githubAnchor": "what-didnt-change-why-the-webserver-outlives-the-cockpit-pane-d12",
          "stableAnchor": "h-468cd8eb1e7e"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A gap named but deliberately not filled: pending gate questions aren't visible remotely (D15)",
          "anchor": "a-gap-named-but-deliberately-not-filled-pending-gate-questions-arent-visible-remotely-d15",
          "githubAnchor": "a-gap-named-but-deliberately-not-filled-pending-gate-questions-arent-visible-remotely-d15",
          "stableAnchor": "h-abb78ee75369"
        }
