          "level": 1,
          "text": "Worktree-dispatch attestation, level 1: advisory-only, never a gate",
          "anchor": "worktree-dispatch-attestation-level-1-advisory-only-never-a-gate",
          "githubAnchor": "worktree-dispatch-attestation-level-1-advisory-only-never-a-gate",
          "stableAnchor": "h-990bfc6b0bac"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "The two halves",
          "anchor": "the-two-halves",
          "githubAnchor": "the-two-halves",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0f0a83eab2ea"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why the two functions treat a missing footprint oppositely",
          "anchor": "why-the-two-functions-treat-a-missing-footprint-oppositely",
          "githubAnchor": "why-the-two-functions-treat-a-missing-footprint-oppositely",
          "stableAnchor": "h-4c4821163284"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Follow-up (`tsk-4hl`): the capture was pointed at the wrong ref, and neither half was actually wired in",
          "anchor": "follow-up-tsk-4hl-the-capture-was-pointed-at-the-wrong-ref-and-neither-half-was-actually-wired-in",
          "githubAnchor": "follow-up-tsk-4hl-the-capture-was-pointed-at-the-wrong-ref-and-neither-half-was-actually-wired-in",
          "stableAnchor": "h-eecd3cac96bc"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Second follow-up (`tsk-x5r`): a real test failure on `main`, and `footprintDiffHits` flagging fgOS's own state files",
          "anchor": "second-follow-up-tsk-x5r-a-real-test-failure-on-main-and-footprintdiffhits-flagging-fgoss-own-state-files",
          "githubAnchor": "second-follow-up-tsk-x5r-a-real-test-failure-on-main-and-footprintdiffhits-flagging-fgoss-own-state-files",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e548db9407d2"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Third follow-up (`tsk-5iv`): the `.fgos/` exemption above was too broad, and hid real edits",
          "anchor": "third-follow-up-tsk-5iv-the-fgos-exemption-above-was-too-broad-and-hid-real-edits",
          "githubAnchor": "third-follow-up-tsk-5iv-the-fgos-exemption-above-was-too-broad-and-hid-real-edits",
          "stableAnchor": "h-adbfdb23fce9"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Fourth follow-up (`tsk-34o5`): Attestation level 2 — enforcement halt at reap/return/approve",
          "anchor": "fourth-follow-up-tsk-34o5-attestation-level-2-enforcement-halt-at-reapreturnapprove",
          "githubAnchor": "fourth-follow-up-tsk-34o5-attestation-level-2-enforcement-halt-at-reapreturnapprove",
          "stableAnchor": "h-8adc887cdd49"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Why level 1 vs level 2",
          "anchor": "why-level-1-vs-level-2",
          "githubAnchor": "why-level-1-vs-level-2",
          "stableAnchor": "h-237ba98154a4"
        }
