        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "A Note On What Failure Looks Like",
          "anchor": "a-note-on-what-failure-looks-like",
          "githubAnchor": "a-note-on-what-failure-looks-like",
          "stableAnchor": "h-7b2576ff0d54"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "1. Understanding Improved Beyond The Initial Wording",
          "anchor": "1-understanding-improved-beyond-the-initial-wording",
          "githubAnchor": "1-understanding-improved-beyond-the-initial-wording",
          "stableAnchor": "h-8ed9ad021f36"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2. Questions Were Necessary, Consolidated, And Well Explained",
          "anchor": "2-questions-were-necessary-consolidated-and-well-explained",
          "githubAnchor": "2-questions-were-necessary-consolidated-and-well-explained",
          "stableAnchor": "h-ec5dcd9b8510"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "3. Alternatives Were Materially Different And Credible",
          "anchor": "3-alternatives-were-materially-different-and-credible",
          "githubAnchor": "3-alternatives-were-materially-different-and-credible",
          "stableAnchor": "h-99fd470ec623"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "4. Evidence Contradicted As Well As Supported Early Hypotheses",
          "anchor": "4-evidence-contradicted-as-well-as-supported-early-hypotheses",
          "githubAnchor": "4-evidence-contradicted-as-well-as-supported-early-hypotheses",
          "stableAnchor": "h-6fffdc1ab334"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "5. Advisors Could Change Their Minds And Explain Why",
          "anchor": "5-advisors-could-change-their-minds-and-explain-why",
          "githubAnchor": "5-advisors-could-change-their-minds-and-explain-why",
          "stableAnchor": "h-64b513a45b03"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "6. Dissent Survived Synthesis",
          "anchor": "6-dissent-survived-synthesis",
          "githubAnchor": "6-dissent-survived-synthesis",
          "stableAnchor": "h-6b7b47d5553a"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "7. The Recommendation Was Decisive But Properly Calibrated",
          "anchor": "7-the-recommendation-was-decisive-but-properly-calibrated",
          "githubAnchor": "7-the-recommendation-was-decisive-but-properly-calibrated",
          "stableAnchor": "h-fa348da7ffc7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "8. The Explanation Enabled The Person To Own The Decision",
          "anchor": "8-the-explanation-enabled-the-person-to-own-the-decision",
          "githubAnchor": "8-the-explanation-enabled-the-person-to-own-the-decision",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9e394ab277e7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "9. A Fresh Coordinator Could Resume From Artifacts Alone",
          "anchor": "9-a-fresh-coordinator-could-resume-from-artifacts-alone",
          "githubAnchor": "9-a-fresh-coordinator-could-resume-from-artifacts-alone",
          "stableAnchor": "h-105c0812dd2f"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "10. Provider/Model Diversity Improved Independence Rather Than Decorating The Roster",
          "anchor": "10-providermodel-diversity-improved-independence-rather-than-decorating-the-roster",
          "githubAnchor": "10-providermodel-diversity-improved-independence-rather-than-decorating-the-roster",
          "stableAnchor": "h-78e42bbb18b6"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "11. Every Shaper Stated Falsification Criteria Before Critics Saw The Proposal",
          "anchor": "11-every-shaper-stated-falsification-criteria-before-critics-saw-the-proposal",
          "githubAnchor": "11-every-shaper-stated-falsification-criteria-before-critics-saw-the-proposal",
          "stableAnchor": "h-df11b657e610"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "12. The Person's Assessment Came First, And The Evaluator Was Not The Driver",
