      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "P05.1 crash-state snapshot — exact commands/output captured live, right after the real kill -9 and before the resume attempt",
          "anchor": "p051-crash-state-snapshot-exact-commandsoutput-captured-live-right-after-the-real-kill--9-and-before-the-resume-attempt",
          "githubAnchor": "p051-crash-state-snapshot-exact-commandsoutput-captured-live-right-after-the-real-kill--9-and-before-the-resume-attempt",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c530cacac083"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "1. OS-level confirmation all three real PIDs are actually dead (not just exited cleanly)",
          "anchor": "1-os-level-confirmation-all-three-real-pids-are-actually-dead-not-just-exited-cleanly",
          "githubAnchor": "1-os-level-confirmation-all-three-real-pids-are-actually-dead-not-just-exited-cleanly",
          "stableAnchor": "h-e5edb2d46c1c"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "2. `fgos coordination show aap_p051_main --json`, run from a genuinely fresh process, immediately after the kill",
          "anchor": "2-fgos-coordination-show-aap_p051_main---json-run-from-a-genuinely-fresh-process-immediately-after-the-kill",
          "githubAnchor": "2-fgos-coordination-show-aap_p051_main---json-run-from-a-genuinely-fresh-process-immediately-after-the-kill",
          "stableAnchor": "h-799175f02718"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "3. On-disk assignment state for the interrupted binding, before any reconciliation",
          "anchor": "3-on-disk-assignment-state-for-the-interrupted-binding-before-any-reconciliation",
          "githubAnchor": "3-on-disk-assignment-state-for-the-interrupted-binding-before-any-reconciliation",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b30bc0749e37"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "4. The real, disclosed gap: `dispatch.claim` blocks CLI-only resume",
          "anchor": "4-the-real-disclosed-gap-dispatchclaim-blocks-cli-only-resume",
          "githubAnchor": "4-the-real-disclosed-gap-dispatchclaim-blocks-cli-only-resume",
          "stableAnchor": "h-85d2141616af"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "5. Manual reconciliation, then a clean resume",
          "anchor": "5-manual-reconciliation-then-a-clean-resume",
          "githubAnchor": "5-manual-reconciliation-then-a-clean-resume",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0f994d5ad56f"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "6. Correction — this clean resume was a timing accident, not the general case (independent Review + Red-Team)",
          "anchor": "6-correction-this-clean-resume-was-a-timing-accident-not-the-general-case-independent-review-red-team",
          "githubAnchor": "6-correction-this-clean-resume-was-a-timing-accident-not-the-general-case-independent-review-red-team",
