          "stableAnchor": "h-13d2ae0aedb1"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "LOW — `--work <id>` lookup accepts JS built-in prototype property names as a \"found\" Work instead of erroring, silently downgrading to a no-op rather than surfacing the caller's mistake (pre-existing pattern, not unique to this cell)",
          "anchor": "low---work-lookup-accepts-js-built-in-prototype-property-names-as-a-found-work-instead-of-erroring-silently-downgrading-to-a-no-op-rather-than-surfacing-the-callers-mistake-pre-existing-pattern-not-unique-to-this-cell",
          "githubAnchor": "low---work-lookup-accepts-js-built-in-prototype-property-names-as-a-found-work-instead-of-erroring-silently-downgrading-to-a-no-op-rather-than-surfacing-the-callers-mistake-pre-existing-pattern-not-unique-to-this-cell",
