          "stableAnchor": "h-aa3de297b2a7"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Review",
          "anchor": "review",
          "githubAnchor": "review",
          "stableAnchor": "h-feb23f496a94"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "HIGH — Crash-then-retry after an interrupted `assignment-created` write can duplicate the Assignment for one logical task, violating the contract's Required Negative Test #3",
          "anchor": "high-crash-then-retry-after-an-interrupted-assignment-created-write-can-duplicate-the-assignment-for-one-logical-task-violating-the-contracts-required-negative-test-3",
          "githubAnchor": "high-crash-then-retry-after-an-interrupted-assignment-created-write-can-duplicate-the-assignment-for-one-logical-task-violating-the-contracts-required-negative-test-3",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b68b3a0ea411"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "MEDIUM — Only `replaySession` checks `schemaVersion`; every mutating store operation (`createSessionAssignment`, `bindActor`, `linkResult`, `transitionSessionStatus`) reads the manifest via `readManifestRaw`, which never compares `schemaVersion` against the running `SCHEMA_VERSION`",
          "anchor": "medium-only-replaysession-checks-schemaversion-every-mutating-store-operation-createsessionassignment-bindactor-linkresult-transitionsessionstatus-reads-the-manifest-via-readmanifestraw-which-never-compares-schemaversion-against-the-running-schema_version",
          "githubAnchor": "medium-only-replaysession-checks-schemaversion-every-mutating-store-operation-createsessionassignment-bindactor-linkresult-transitionsessionstatus-reads-the-manifest-via-readmanifestraw-which-never-compares-schemaversion-against-the-running-schema_version",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9bff661546cf"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "LOW — Doer's \"no new failure beyond baseline\" full-suite claim did not reproduce exactly; one failure title not in the 11-item baseline surfaced on my own full-suite run",
