          "level": 3,
          "text": "HIGH — The accepted HIGH fix's own retry fast-path returns a \"successful\" Assignment that is never actually added to the session (no `assignment-created` event, no `assignmentRefs` entry), permanently, with no self-heal — reopening the exact contract requirement it was dispatched to close",
