      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "P06.3 — Independent Review (Proof And Promotion, closes Phase 06 / MVP6)",
          "anchor": "p063-independent-review-proof-and-promotion-closes-phase-06-mvp6",
          "githubAnchor": "p063-independent-review-proof-and-promotion-closes-phase-06-mvp6",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9762ccf19984"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Verdict",
          "anchor": "verdict",
          "githubAnchor": "verdict",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0fa59eb9187f"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "What I independently verified as correct",
          "anchor": "what-i-independently-verified-as-correct",
          "githubAnchor": "what-i-independently-verified-as-correct",
          "stableAnchor": "h-d84f396b4e28"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Findings",
          "anchor": "findings",
          "githubAnchor": "findings",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a58caf165798"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1. MEDIUM — a window with an empty `opensAfter.operationRefs[]` is permanently open, and the promoted text neither names it nor tests it",
          "anchor": "1-medium-a-window-with-an-empty-opensafteroperationrefs-is-permanently-open-and-the-promoted-text-neither-names-it-nor-tests-it",
          "githubAnchor": "1-medium-a-window-with-an-empty-opensafteroperationrefs-is-permanently-open-and-the-promoted-text-neither-names-it-nor-tests-it",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a02d0a9c26b5"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "2. MEDIUM — two decisions P06.2 explicitly assigned to P06.3 were never recorded as decided",
          "anchor": "2-medium-two-decisions-p062-explicitly-assigned-to-p063-were-never-recorded-as-decided",
          "githubAnchor": "2-medium-two-decisions-p062-explicitly-assigned-to-p063-were-never-recorded-as-decided",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9a686fba0ee8"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "3. MEDIUM-LOW — the promoted \"Required Negative Tests\" section asserts a test that does not exist",
          "anchor": "3-medium-low-the-promoted-required-negative-tests-section-asserts-a-test-that-does-not-exist",
          "githubAnchor": "3-medium-low-the-promoted-required-negative-tests-section-asserts-a-test-that-does-not-exist",
          "stableAnchor": "h-b1ce73e884ce"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "4. LOW — the foreign-session guarantee is stated in absolute form, but rests on the event-log invariant, not on any session scoping of `assignments/`",
          "anchor": "4-low-the-foreign-session-guarantee-is-stated-in-absolute-form-but-rests-on-the-event-log-invariant-not-on-any-session-scoping-of-assignments",
