        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "5. LOW — \"it is the only channel consulted\" overstates what the code does",
          "anchor": "5-low-it-is-the-only-channel-consulted-overstates-what-the-code-does",
          "githubAnchor": "5-low-it-is-the-only-channel-consulted-overstates-what-the-code-does",
          "stableAnchor": "h-68cd6a42a142"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "6. LOW — the `CoordinationProtocol` YAML shape block was not updated",
          "anchor": "6-low-the-coordinationprotocol-yaml-shape-block-was-not-updated",
          "githubAnchor": "6-low-the-coordinationprotocol-yaml-shape-block-was-not-updated",
          "stableAnchor": "h-5516ef00cf7b"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "7. LOW — the terminal-authorization test's first assertion is too loose to prove what the scenario is about",
          "anchor": "7-low-the-terminal-authorization-tests-first-assertion-is-too-loose-to-prove-what-the-scenario-is-about",
