      "headings": [
        {
          "level": 1,
          "text": "P08.2 — Independent Red-Team",
          "anchor": "p082-independent-red-team",
          "githubAnchor": "p082-independent-red-team",
          "stableAnchor": "h-5f8c8311df78"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 1 — The new `contribution:` ownership check, directly",
          "anchor": "attack-1-the-new-contribution-ownership-check-directly",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-1-the-new-contribution-ownership-check-directly",
          "stableAnchor": "h-9217515a92e9"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1a. Contribution-shaped `targetRef` WITHOUT the reserved prefix — **HELD (fail-safe)**",
          "anchor": "1a-contribution-shaped-targetref-without-the-reserved-prefix-held-fail-safe",
          "githubAnchor": "1a-contribution-shaped-targetref-without-the-reserved-prefix-held-fail-safe",
          "stableAnchor": "h-72f37022eae5"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1b. Mixed prefix with a foreign contribution id embedded — **HELD**",
          "anchor": "1b-mixed-prefix-with-a-foreign-contribution-id-embedded-held",
          "githubAnchor": "1b-mixed-prefix-with-a-foreign-contribution-id-embedded-held",
          "stableAnchor": "h-c1273b39a3be"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "1c. `contributionId` has no shape constraint at all — **BROKE (LOW)**",
          "anchor": "1c-contributionid-has-no-shape-constraint-at-all-broke-low",
          "githubAnchor": "1c-contributionid-has-no-shape-constraint-at-all-broke-low",
          "stableAnchor": "h-5eef5a406532"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 2 — `linkSessionContribution`'s definition resolution",
          "anchor": "attack-2-linksessioncontributions-definition-resolution",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-2-linksessioncontributions-definition-resolution",
          "stableAnchor": "h-de68c5544a42"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "2a. Caller-supplied definition/window/operation — **HELD, and this is the cell's strongest result**",
          "anchor": "2a-caller-supplied-definitionwindowoperation-held-and-this-is-the-cells-strongest-result",
          "githubAnchor": "2a-caller-supplied-definitionwindowoperation-held-and-this-is-the-cells-strongest-result",
          "stableAnchor": "h-dcd187190dc4"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "2b. Same-`{id, version}` definition CONTENT swap defeats the window gate entirely — **BROKE (MEDIUM)**",
          "anchor": "2b-same-id-version-definition-content-swap-defeats-the-window-gate-entirely-broke-medium",
          "githubAnchor": "2b-same-id-version-definition-content-swap-defeats-the-window-gate-entirely-broke-medium",
          "stableAnchor": "h-0bb67c28e8db"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 3 — Content-freedom",
          "anchor": "attack-3-content-freedom",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-3-content-freedom",
          "stableAnchor": "h-8c53275c3b08"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "3a. Named content/mailbox fields — **HELD**",
          "anchor": "3a-named-contentmailbox-fields-held",
          "githubAnchor": "3a-named-contentmailbox-fields-held",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a427625b2f9c"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "3b. `roundKey` is an unbounded verbatim string channel into the immutable ledger — **BROKE (LOW-MEDIUM)**",
          "anchor": "3b-roundkey-is-an-unbounded-verbatim-string-channel-into-the-immutable-ledger-broke-low-medium",
          "githubAnchor": "3b-roundkey-is-an-unbounded-verbatim-string-channel-into-the-immutable-ledger-broke-low-medium",
          "stableAnchor": "h-998cce712fd2"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 4 — Window/context legality reuse",
          "anchor": "attack-4-windowcontext-legality-reuse",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-4-windowcontext-legality-reuse",
          "stableAnchor": "h-780a9d689596"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "4a. Is `deriveVisibilityWindowState` called correctly, with fresh state? — **HELD**",
          "anchor": "4a-is-derivevisibilitywindowstate-called-correctly-with-fresh-state-held",
          "githubAnchor": "4a-is-derivevisibilitywindowstate-called-correctly-with-fresh-state-held",
          "stableAnchor": "h-baee9f89b5a2"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "4b. TOCTOU (window closes between derivation and append)? — **HELD, structurally**",
          "anchor": "4b-toctou-window-closes-between-derivation-and-append-held-structurally",
          "githubAnchor": "4b-toctou-window-closes-between-derivation-and-append-held-structurally",
          "stableAnchor": "h-72f89f4682c0"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "4c. The window is checked at LINK time, not at REASONING time — **BROKE (MEDIUM)**",
          "anchor": "4c-the-window-is-checked-at-link-time-not-at-reasoning-time-broke-medium",
          "githubAnchor": "4c-the-window-is-checked-at-link-time-not-at-reasoning-time-broke-medium",
          "stableAnchor": "h-171f5a168581"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 5 — The \"no mutable status\" claim",
          "anchor": "attack-5-the-no-mutable-status-claim",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-5-the-no-mutable-status-claim",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a6e4e07c4bec"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "5a. No stored status field; derivation is real — **HELD**",
          "anchor": "5a-no-stored-status-field-derivation-is-real-held",
          "githubAnchor": "5a-no-stored-status-field-derivation-is-real-held",
          "stableAnchor": "h-3463c407a5a6"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "5b. Forging open→resolved: through the mediated/store door — **HELD**",
          "anchor": "5b-forging-openresolved-through-the-mediatedstore-door-held",
          "githubAnchor": "5b-forging-openresolved-through-the-mediatedstore-door-held",
          "stableAnchor": "h-3fbac1ac052b"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "5c. Forging open→resolved on the log: **replay never checks the resolving disposition's driver identity** — **BROKE (MEDIUM)**",
          "anchor": "5c-forging-openresolved-on-the-log-replay-never-checks-the-resolving-dispositions-driver-identity-broke-medium",
          "githubAnchor": "5c-forging-openresolved-on-the-log-replay-never-checks-the-resolving-dispositions-driver-identity-broke-medium",
          "stableAnchor": "h-af3d16b35b51"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "5d. A disposition that PRECEDES the contribution still resolves it — **BROKE (LOW)**",
          "anchor": "5d-a-disposition-that-precedes-the-contribution-still-resolves-it-broke-low",
          "githubAnchor": "5d-a-disposition-that-precedes-the-contribution-still-resolves-it-broke-low",
          "stableAnchor": "h-47742ab32b71"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "5e. Any disposition string resolves — **INFO**",
          "anchor": "5e-any-disposition-string-resolves-info",
          "githubAnchor": "5e-any-disposition-string-resolves-info",
          "stableAnchor": "h-51bd9d9b157b"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 6 — The three self-disclosed gaps, tested for exploitability",
          "anchor": "attack-6-the-three-self-disclosed-gaps-tested-for-exploitability",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-6-the-three-self-disclosed-gaps-tested-for-exploitability",
          "stableAnchor": "h-a1021de1f2a3"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "6a. Missing `contributions.allowedTypes[]` — **disclosure is accurate; no worse outcome today**",
          "anchor": "6a-missing-contributionsallowedtypes-disclosure-is-accurate-no-worse-outcome-today",
          "githubAnchor": "6a-missing-contributionsallowedtypes-disclosure-is-accurate-no-worse-outcome-today",
          "stableAnchor": "h-1fd14941ea17"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "6b. The MVP6 `required`-binding residual, combined with this cell — **it does get worse: see 4c**",
          "anchor": "6b-the-mvp6-required-binding-residual-combined-with-this-cell-it-does-get-worse-see-4c",
          "githubAnchor": "6b-the-mvp6-required-binding-residual-combined-with-this-cell-it-does-get-worse-see-4c",
          "stableAnchor": "h-493033582fc0"
        },
        {
          "level": 3,
          "text": "6d. `knownAssignments` self-consistency — **disclosure accurate**",
          "anchor": "6d-knownassignments-self-consistency-disclosure-accurate",
          "githubAnchor": "6d-knownassignments-self-consistency-disclosure-accurate",
          "stableAnchor": "h-82a7a0d740a8"
        },
        {
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Attack 7 — Regression sweep and layering",
          "anchor": "attack-7-regression-sweep-and-layering",
          "githubAnchor": "attack-7-regression-sweep-and-layering",
          "stableAnchor": "h-3f5f1437ce41"
        },
